   "text": "Western Sydney University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWestern Sydney University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWestern Sydney University is a world-class university with international reach, with a reputation for academic excellence and impact-driven research. With a campus located in the city and a focus on the community, the University is able to challenge the traditional notions of what a university ‘should’ be and pushes the boundaries of knowledge exchange.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:27\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n08/04/2026 06:32\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$37,488.00\nMin: A$28,928.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n25%\n1,500 of 6,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1989\nCampus(es)\nSydney\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n04/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.westernsydney.edu.au/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.westernsydney.edu.au/international/applying/fees-and-costs/scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5dkuV5992E\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
